  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 1000) #8697, eff 8-3-06; ss by #9149, eff 5-1-08 (from Adm 1002.02); ss by #10728, eff 11-25-14; ss by #13050, eff 7-1-20 (formerly Adm 1002.02)",
