  "prefLabel": "Adm 1002.03 Defendant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 1002.03 \"Defendant\" means an adult charged with a crime, a juvenile charged with delinquency or, where the context requires such meaning, a person liable under RSA 604-A:2-a for the support of a juvenile charged with delinquency.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 1000) #8697, eff 8-3-06; ss by #9149, eff 5-1-08 (from Adm 1002.02); ss by #10728, eff 11-25-14; ss by #13050, eff 7-1-20 (formerly Adm 1002.02)",
